=== plain-80: width 80, height 24, profile notty, dark, glyphs ascii, plain
  menu-layout mixed --------------------------------------------$
$
# Note$
# Adopted 2026-11-14: no Figma frame. A host in mixed states: a$
# row that is not Configured keeps its word. A line under a row$
# starts two cells in, whatever the row.$
$
Mixed states:$
  [+] User                 + non-root, sudo$
                             ~ passwordless sudo$
  [ ] SSH                  Review ~ password auth on$
  [?] Firewall             Unknown ~ can't read$
                             ~ Counted as not configured$
  [ ] Kernel               Partial ~ 1 set outside hardn$
  [ ] Auto Updates         Review ~ no unattended-upgrades$
  [-] AppArmor             set by the host$
$
No colour:$
  [+] User                 + non-root, sudo$
                             ~ passwordless sudo$
  [ ] SSH                  Review ~ password auth on$
  [?] Firewall             Unknown ~ can't read$
                             ~ Counted as not configured$
  [ ] Kernel               Partial ~ 1 set outside hardn$
  [ ] Auto Updates         Review ~ no unattended-upgrades$
  [-] AppArmor             set by the host$
$
$

